<http://data.silknow.org/object/412a8255-e04f-3de9-9b70-1b44931685af/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Imperial robe of silk brocade, woven in coloured silks, gold thread, and strips of gilt-paper on a green ground. \nThe design is composed of five-clawed dragons pursuing or grasping flaming jewels amid scrolled clouds. Branches of coral, jewel beads, horn-shaped wine-cups, rolls of precious stuffs, sceptres bound with fillets and other symbolic objects float on the sea waves along the lower border of the robe. Lined with terra-cotta silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/412a8255-e04f-3de9-9b70-1b44931685af> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/412a8255-e04f-3de9-9b70-1b44931685af>
